  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**Given :** 100 × 5 − 110 ÷ 2 + 12 = 210\n\n**According to the question, after replacing the two numbers and two signs :**\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 2 and 12; × and +\n\n100 + 5 − **110 ÷ 12**__ × 2 = 210\n\n100 + 5 − __**9.17 ×**____** 2**__ = 210\n\n__**100 + 5**__ − 18.34 = 210\n\n__**105 − 18.34**__ = 210\n\n86.66 ≠ 210 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : **5 and 2; + and −**\n\n100 × 2 + **110 ÷ 5**__ - 12 = 210\n\n__**100 × 2**__ + 22 - 12 = 210\n\n__**200 + 22**__ - 12 = 210\n\n__**222 - 12**__ = 210\n\n210 = 210 (LHS RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 2 and 12; ÷ and ×\n\n**100 ÷ 5**__ − 110 × 2 + 12 = 210\n\n20 − __**110 × 2**__ + 12 = 210\n\n__**20 +12**__ - 220 = 210\n\n__**32 - 220**__ = 210\n\n-188 ≠ 210 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 12 and 5; × and −\n\n100 - 5 × **110 ÷ 2**__ + 12 = 210\n\n100 - __**5 **____**× 55**__ + 15 = 210\n\n__**100 + 15**__ - 275 = 210\n\n__**115 - 275**__ = 210\n\n-160 ≠ 210 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
